        },
        {
          "text": " Musa na Arooni baakora nk'oku MUKAMA abaragiire; yaimutsya egyo nkoni, yaateera amaizi g'omu mugyera omu maisho ga Faraho n'abaheereza be; amaizi goona ag'omu mugyera gaahinduka eshagama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eby'enyanja ebyabaire biri omu mugyera byafa; omugyera gwanuuka ekijunde, Abanyamisri tibaabaasa kunywa maizi gaagwo; haabaho eshagama omu nsi ya Misri yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafumu ba Misri baakora batyo n'oburogo bwabo; omutima gwa Faraho gwagangaara, tiyaabahurira, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faraho yaarugayo, yaagaruka omuka, n'ekyo tiyaakyetaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamisri boona baatimba haihi n'omugyera, ngu batungye amaizi g'okunywa; ahakuba tibarabaasize kunywa ha maizi g'omuri ogwo mugyera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haahinguraho ebiro mushanju, MUKAMA aherize kuteera ogwo mugyera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
